@startuml
title Payment State Diagram

state "PENDING" as Pending
state "COMPLETED" as Completed

[*] --> Pending : Reservation created

Pending --> Completed : Payment successful\nReservation confirmed

Pending --> [*] : Reservation expires
Pending --> [*] : Reservation cancelled

Completed --> [*] : Reservation cancelled

note right of Pending
PaymentStatus.PENDING

Created automatically together
with the reservation.
end note

note right of Completed
PaymentStatus.COMPLETED

The reservation is also
changed to RESERVED.
end note

@enduml
